a states this exactly.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-010\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"the band could never attempt one while a single ringer was missing\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_a.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Source_a states the band could never attempt a full peal while a single ringer was missing.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-011\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"We could not attempt a full peal with fewer than eight ringers\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_b.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Source_b states this regarding the band's capability.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-012\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"one absence was enough to call the whole thing off\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_b.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Source_b states one absence was enough to cancel the peal.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-013\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"Once the ringing starts a full peal runs for two hours\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_a.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Source_a states this exactly.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-014\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"the band works through it without a break\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_a.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Source_a states the band works through a full peal without a break.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-015\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"From the first stroke to the last a full peal took two hours\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_b.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Source_b states this exactly.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-016\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"nobody left the ringing chamber in between\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_b.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Source_b 